%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WarehouseAdmin as Workshop Warehouse Administrator
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as OfflineSaleService
    participant Records as StockRepository
    participant Dep as PaymentService
    WarehouseAdmin->>UI: Select a spare part and sale quantity
    UI->>Service: Submit offline spare part sale request
    Service->>Records: Exclude pending units and check available stock
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate jumlah unit available mencukupi tanpa unit held
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: recordCash(booking, amount)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Record the cash sale and consume sold units
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display the completed sale
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Reject a quantity that exceeds available stock
        UI-->>WarehouseAdmin: Display the reason and required action
    end
